      "priority": "Orta",
      "preconditions": "OBU has computed a speed restriction based on permitted braking distance data.",
      "test_inputs": "Change in a parameter not listed in SUBSET-026 §3.11.11 as an input for PBD computation (e.g., a non-relevant trackside signal aspect).",
